# Metatag ladder rungs — MEASURED receipt (2026-10-18)
# Seed repo proved only the 256<->1024 rung. This proves the lossless byte<->symbol round-trip
# for every rung the shipped u16 codec represents (width 1..16), AND that the ladder is not
